  "title": "Baibars (Baybars I)",
  "summary": "Baybars was born around 1223 among the Kipchak Turks near the north shore of the Black Sea. Serving under Sultan Qutuz, he led the charge against the Mongols at Ayn Jalut in September 1260, then became the fourth Mamluk sultan. He ruled until he died in Damascus on 1 July 1277.",
